<div data-ecdhs-green-mail="1" style="background-color:#dcefe0;border:1px solid #b8d8bf;border-radius:8px;padding:18px 20px;color:#2f3b4a;">
<p>Dear Vetting Team,</p>

<p>The following contract has been submitted for vetting and sign-off:</p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" style="margin:12px 0;">
    <tr><td><strong>Contract Reference:</strong></td><td><t t-out="object.name"/></td></tr>
    <tr><td><strong>Contract Subject:</strong></td><td><t t-out="object.subject"/></td></tr>
    <tr><td><strong>Contract Type:</strong></td><td><t t-out="dict(object._fields['contract_type'].selection).get(object.contract_type, '')"/></td></tr>
    <tr><td><strong>Service Provider:</strong></td><td><t t-out="object.service_provider_id.name"/></td></tr>
    <tr><td><strong>Contract Value:</strong></td><td><t t-out="format_amount(object.contract_value, object.currency_id)"/></td></tr>
</table>

<p>Please complete vetting and advise on Vetting Team sign-off within <strong>5 working days</strong>.</p>

<p style="margin:16px 0;"><a t-att-href="object.get_base_url() + '/web#model=ecdhs.contract&amp;id=' + str(object.id)" style="display:inline-block;padding:8px 18px;background-color:#875A7B;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;font-weight:bold;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;">Open Contract: <t t-out="object.name"/></a></p>

<p>Kind regards,<br/><strong>ECDHS Contract Management Unit</strong></p>
</div>
            ]]></field>
            <field name="lang">en_US</field>
            <field name="auto_delete">False</field>
        </record>

        <record id="mail_template_contract_memo_required" model="mail.template">
